// Every explanation card of the explain mode, in the recommended style, in
// Finnish and US English (proto-explain-mode-r6). This file is the round's
// content: build.mjs embeds it, the page draws the cards from it, and the
// implementation is meant to move it into a catalog (web/src/text/) as it is.
//
// A card: id (what Jari points at), area, kind, sel (the production element:
// its own test id or class, no coordinates), optional views (only there),
// key (shortcut as a value, not inside a sentence), go (the captured view
// Kokeile shows), and per language name / lead / know / try / grey / menu:
//   name  the element's name as the screen shows it
//   lead  what it does for you, one sentence (at most about 12 words)
//   know  the one thing worth knowing, one sentence (at most about 20 words)
//   try   Kokeile's label; absent where trying would change something lasting
//   grey  why it is grey, shown only when the element is disabled
//   menu  shown when the element is a row of ⋯ instead of the top bar

